{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"伊藤純奈です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/junna.itou/img/junna.itou/img/2017/04/17/2600271/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/junna.itou/img/junna.itou/img/2017/04/17/2600271/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オフショット〜〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"舞台「犬夜叉」、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全公演が無事に終了致しました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"会場に足を運んで下さったみなさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブビューイングを見て下さったみなさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お家で応援をしてくれていたみなさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"犬夜叉に関わってくださったみなさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"演出家の茅野さんにたくさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ご指導して頂いて、そして素敵な"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"キャストのみなさんからも吸収する"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"事がたくさんありました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に勉強になりました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2度目の舞台で最初は不安だらけ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だった純奈も本番は楽しむ事が"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"出来ました〜！ほんとにたのしかった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回この舞台をやって前よりも更に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"演技のお仕事がしたいって思うように"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なりました。もっと色んな勉強がしたいです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"桔梗ちゃん、ありがとう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またやりたいなあ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/junna.itou/img/junna.itou/img/2017/04/17/2600271/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/junna.itou/img/junna.itou/img/2017/04/17/2600271/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わかさま！だいすきなおねーちゃん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一緒に舞台に立てて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うれしかった〜〜！ほんとに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごいのわかさま。ストイックで。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも刺激をもらってました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わかさまがいたから頑張れた！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また一緒に演技したいなあ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/junna.itou/img/junna.itou/img/2017/04/17/2600271/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"犬夜叉という作品に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"関わる事が出来てとても"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幸せでした！ありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、本番が終わってやっと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダーライブのリハーサルに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"合流しました！これからつめて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いくのでちょっぴり大変だし、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"不安でいっぱいだけど本番は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素敵なパフォーマンスをお見せするので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん楽しみにしててください！"}],"source":"archive"}